    "reason": "Not required, because no band change is proposed. Recorded for completeness: the McKinney v. Scale AI settlement record in San Francisco Superior Court is a court record at tier 5; the Business and Human Rights Resource Centre report on Philippine outsourced workers is tier 4 and independent; the National Law Review analysis of Schuster v. Scale AI is tier 4. The test would pass."
